      "description": "A numbered comment connected to the selected image mark.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-comment\"><div class=\"ds-comment-heading\"><button class=\"ds-comment-number\" aria-label=\"Select mark 1\">1</button><span>Pin</span></div><textarea class=\"ds-comment-field\" aria-label=\"Comment for mark 1\">Give the heading a little more breathing room.</textarea></section>",
      "css": ".ds-comment{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;background:#f0f3fc;padding:17px 22px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dfd5)}.ds-comment-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:11px;color:#70685c;margin-bottom:10px}.ds-comment-number{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease,border-color 160ms ease;border:0;display:grid;place-items:center;width:23px;height:23px;border-radius:50%;background:#c94b35;color:white;font-size:11px;font-weight:650;padding:0}.ds-comment-number:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#3456c4);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-comment-field{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease,border-color 160ms ease;cursor:text;width:100%;resize:vertical;min-height:72px;max-height:240px;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;line-height:1.6;font-size:12px;color:#45403a;border-radius:5px;padding:5px 0;caret-color:var(--blue,#3456c4)}.ds-comment-field:focus{border-color:#c4cfea;background:#fff;padding:5px 7px;outline:none}.ds-comment-field::placeholder{color:#70685c}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,a,textarea{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Screenshot navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "screenshot-navigation",
      "description": "A selected preview within the image rail; inline placeholder represents session image content.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Screenshots\"><button class=\"ds-thumb\" aria-label=\"Select screenshot\" aria-current=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-preview\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"m21 15-5-5L5 21\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-image-number\">1</span></span><span class=\"ds-filename\">Screenshot.png</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:#f4f1e9;padding:23px 14px 18px;width:130px}.ds-thumb{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease,border-color 160ms ease;width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;border:0;padding:0;background:none}.ds-preview{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.35;border:2px solid var(--blue,#3456c4);background:#e8edfc;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:4px;color:var(--blue,#3456c4)}.ds-thumb:hover .ds-preview{background:#e3e8f4}.ds-image-number{position:absolute;bottom:5px;left:5px;background:var(--blue,#3456c4);color:white;font-size:10px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-filename{text-align:left;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue,#3456c4);overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-thumb:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#3456c4);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,a,textarea{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Annotation badge",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "annotation-badge",
      "description": "A focused selectable mark at its nominal screen size.",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-mark\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><g role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Mark 1: Pin\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"18\" fill=\"white\" opacity=\".85\"/><circle class=\"ds-badge\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c94b35\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"30\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text></g></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-mark{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;overflow:visible}.ds-mark g{cursor:pointer}.ds-mark g:focus-visible{outline:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 4px #242d7440)}.ds-mark g:focus-visible .ds-badge{stroke:#34322e;stroke-width:3px}.ds-mark text{pointer-events:none}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,a,textarea{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}} .ds-badge{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;animation:ds-pin-pop 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}@keyframes ds-pin-pop{from{opacity:.6;transform:scale(.72)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-badge{animation:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Working Sketchbook",
    "overview": "Warm paper, dark ink, and compact rounded tools frame the screenshot. Cobalt identifies the main action and selected controls; four annotation inks connect marks with their matching comments. The interface is quiet enough to keep image content central.\n\nThis is a desktop-first working surface with precise numbered feedback and light sketchbook cues: a dotted canvas, a tilted pencil icon, and a small rotated empty-state tile. The shipped wordmark uses the system sans; no handwritten font is installed. The selected direction is user-pinned, and the implementation was developed code-first.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm paper with cream working panels.",
      "Compact rounded controls and thin separators.",
      "Cobalt selection and action; distinct colored annotation ink.",
      "Stable numbered marks linked to comments.",
      "Desktop rails become a stacked mobile workspace."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Cobalt Control Rule",
        "body": "Use cobalt for primary actions, selected tools, selected screenshot borders, and keyboard focus. Annotation blue remains its own ink token.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Numbered Mark Rule",
        "body": "Keep the mark number and ink consistent between the image and its comment. Badges and annotation strokes retain their screen size as the image zooms.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Floating Tool Rule",
        "body": "Use soft ambient shadows for the dock, image, and temporary help panel. The permanent rails rely on warm surfaces and thin separators.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep screenshot content central and use the warm paper and cream panel tokens for the application frame.",
      "Do use numbered, color-matched marks and comments; keep annotation geometry legible across zoom levels.",
      "Do preserve visible focus, native keyboard button activation, and reduced motion support.",
      "Do use the darker muted-small token for small labels and placeholders on paper, panel, and overall-message surfaces.",
      "Do adapt the rails into the documented mobile stack while preserving drawing, feedback, and submission controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't copy typography or colors from uploaded screenshots or the fictional example into the application system.",
      "Don't extend the dotted canvas texture into text-entry fields or comment rows.",
      "Don't use annotation ink as the default application action color.",
      "Don't add hard offset shadows or decorative card stacks to the quiet working frame."
    ]
  }
}
